{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "af34d51d53c98d61d138d12d930da9a061c462e1a77b4d04be6285781852f74f", "ja": "どうですかっ、{$P$}さん！\nこの衣装、ブログでもお披露目しましたけど……。", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}先生！\n这套服装我也在博客上展示过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1001_p", "source_sha256": "00a9d637ed1fb59f538b1a5589993d139e395a7028ac27724190589759657ce8", "ja": "ああ。ブログに、ファンからも\nコメントが続々きてる。だいぶ好評だな！", "zh": "是啊，博客上也陆续收到了粉丝们的评论。看来大家相当喜欢啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "7f5db5593bd14a2d6e97c76306a8dc8891ffec6d6540fcc68ab8144cdb487760", "ja": "よかった～！　私、まだ見てなくて……。\nどんなコメントでした？", "zh": "太好了～！我还没看呢……\n都有什么样的评论呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ef1f62f507ac2823ef052fc3a09c5a055b689dcb151947f9fb423b3a69ee3004", "ja": "えーっと……「春香皇帝陛下ばんざーい！」とか、\n「忠誠をお誓いします、春香皇帝陛下殿！」とか。", "zh": "呃……比如“春香皇帝陛下万岁！”、\n还有“我宣誓效忠，春香皇帝陛下！”之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "fe9373f367b1fe77a6c58db8ca53bd080b147bcce84cedd09c095d5b37ac5f0d", "ja": "え、ええっ！？　私、そんな崇められるような\nこと、ブログに書いてましたっけ？", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？我在博客里写过什么值得被那样崇拜的内容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "9c75583a67a7b632edfd382432fdffc4a42d30fa0aa0b307e24a81a18ab8626b", "ja": "でも……タロットの皇帝らしく、びしっとした感じで\nみんなから見てもらえてるなら、嬉しいかな♪", "zh": "不过……如果大家都觉得我像塔罗牌里的皇帝一样，干练利落，那我还是挺开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5e9a6d6588f41e16fc4e7b7767599479deea2f80f1d754fe0445a97b70457bd5", "ja": "うん。衣装、ばっちり着こなせてるぞ。\n凛々しくも冷静沈着な、立派な皇帝のたたずまいだ。", "zh": "嗯。这身服装，你穿得相当合适。看起来就是一位英姿飒爽、沉着冷静的出色皇帝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "c45eea07cb207f1cb3ed582d6bc51c9189da5e241071ffc05bb2c3631dc2cc7e", "ja": "れ、冷静沈着だなんて、全然普段の\n私のイメージじゃないですよね……あはは。", "zh": "说、说我冷静沉着什么的，完全不是平时的我给人的印象吧……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1008_p", "source_sha256": "dff81cfa75d8eead994340cec83f9bcabce5f52a48926515523ff0b45dcfc9c0", "ja": "いやいや。ステージや演技での春香はクールで\nカッコいい面も十分、出せてると思うよ。", "zh": "没有的事。我觉得舞台和演戏上的春香，\n也充分展现出了冷静帅气的一面哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2de63ed62d76cbdab01afeaf7e26b07e4d5f20bdc3a464c51794a2210dde1441", "ja": "それをファンのみんなも知ってるから、\n今回の皇帝も、好評なんじゃないかな。", "zh": "因为粉丝们也都知道这一点，所以这次的“皇帝”才会广受好评吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "ba15fe7917c2d0de97dfcafed14feec326cfc1d01e613ae550b9412eec1fdc98", "ja": "それならいいですけど……ううん、ファンのみんなに\n楽しんでもらえるなら！　私、全力で応えたいです！", "zh": "如果那样就好了……不，只要能让粉丝们开心！我想全力回应大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d207682102405194f98b780a69b0bfc65e04a1cebf20396079d9682edd39f06a", "ja": "よし、その意気だ。……っと、ブログのコメントが\nまたたくさん更新されたな。どれどれ……。", "zh": "好，就是要有这股干劲。……啊，博客的评论又更新了好多。让我看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "ddc38b9ac8560391c5c95133f4a56684f16b7d726226122ca7a3ca0735b75ea4", "ja": "あっ、私も見ますね。……ん？　なんだろう、\nこれ。「イエス・ユア・マジェスティ！」って？", "zh": "啊，我也来看看。……嗯？这是什么啊，\n“Yes，Your Majesty！”是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9810bcd31548436c62004eddfa351bda020514b3a427f264b0941069be4622e7", "ja": "Your Majesty……英語の敬語、かな？\n直接名前を呼んでは恐れ多い陛下への、呼びかけだ。", "zh": "Your Majesty……算是英语里的敬语吧？\n是对不能直呼其名、尊贵无比的陛下所用的称呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "fd520b7a4d92c9b08fe754cd3b17e228a4a550b4953b6146b78567b0e74fe350", "ja": "えっ、それってつまり、\n皇帝になった私へのコール、みたいな……？", "zh": "诶，那也就是说，  \n这是给成为皇帝的我喊的口号……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e1f4fd393137015f8ef2f6d3faa1dc37f16a3d9c827d30868d3859a6d2ffbea0", "ja": "そんな感じだな。客席のみんなから\n陛下コール、してもらいたいか、春香？", "zh": "差不多就是那种感觉。春香，你想不想让观众席的大家为你喊“陛下”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "b424656443c820307d79d98d7a05940e14eaa5c7f7af0c3729cfb162cf227f51", "ja": "ち、ちょっと恥ずかしいですけど……\nでも、面白いかもしれませんねっ！　えへへ♪", "zh": "虽、虽然有点害羞……\n不过，说不定会很有意思呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "32ff971b015c272be4afcdbaf7f840bb9fd15dd6ab5f6a914e56fd9ec5e4b29c", "ja": "こほん。\n「我は皇帝。我の名は春香。我を称えよ！」", "zh": "咳咳。\n“吾乃皇帝。吾名春香。还不快来赞颂吾！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6921deb5c48273fcef3d0aab525192d169395d57af799d7a66a20bbf309741e3", "ja": "「イエス・ユア・マジェスティ！」", "zh": "“Yes, Your Majesty！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "cb1f51d4d607dfe7b295ed8d25fcc3daa46988f341defe9f100874a58b7a1498", "ja": "っ…………。", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b5d2b308fe9d452813e40c4e634ed14d41ecd75eaa08d2616bbc84c5e0b8755b", "ja": "なんてな。\n……あれ、春香？", "zh": "开玩笑的。\n……咦，春香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0204_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "2e5f124331854f316bc08497b5ae89da9e510e674a48413433fe31492dcb7ed7", "ja": "は、はいっ！　……意外と、気持ちよかったかも？\nってなんでもないです、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊、好的！……没想到，感觉还挺舒服的？  \n不，没什么，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
